    {
      "id": "OpeningFire",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Long ago, the peoples of Heynbord went to war. The war burned for so long that the world almost turned to ash.",
        "id-id": "Dahulu kala, bangsa-bangsa Heynbord saling berperang. Perang itu berkobar begitu lama hingga dunia nyaris menjadi abu."
      },
