    {
      "id": "OpeningAccord",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Then the Lanekeepers drew three lanes of light and wrote the Accord. Since that day, every war is fought in the lanes, by the same rules.",
        "id-id": "Lalu para Lanekeeper menggambar tiga jalur cahaya dan menulis Accord. Sejak hari itu, setiap perang terjadi di jalur, dengan aturan yang sama."
      },
      "startFrame": 270,
      "endFrame": 540,
      "sceneKind": "opening",
      "momentOrder": 2,
