    {
      "id": "BossHall",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "At the end of the road stands Brassbelly Hall. Its torches light one by one. Someone expects you. / Baron: Open the gates! Our famous guest has walked a long way to see me.",
        "id-id": "Di ujung jalan berdiri Brassbelly Hall. Obor-obornya menyala satu per satu. Seseorang sudah menunggumu. / Baron: Buka gerbangnya! Tamu terkenal kita sudah berjalan jauh untuk menemuiku."
      },
