    {
      "id": "BossBaron",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Baron: So you are the Hero who broke my toll gates, burned my camp and scared off my Orcs. Do you know what that cost me? / You: Less than you took from Hearthvale.",
        "id-id": "Baron: Jadi kamu Hero yang merusak gerbang tolku, membakar kemahku, dan menakuti Orc-Orc-ku. Kamu tahu berapa kerugianku? / You: Masih lebih sedikit daripada yang kamu ambil dari Hearthvale."
      },
      "startFrame": 1620,
      "endFrame": 1890,
      "sceneKind": "boss",
