    {
      "id": "BossChallenge",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Baron: Enough talk! Shieldbearer, show our guest the way out! / You: Hearthvale's roads open today. Starting with your door.",
        "id-id": "Baron: Cukup bicaranya! Shieldbearer, tunjukkan jalan keluar kepada tamu kita! / You: Jalan-jalan Hearthvale terbuka hari ini. Dimulai dari pintumu."
