      "text": {
        "en-us": "Brassbelly's banner falls. The roads are open, and the carts roll again. For once, the Baron has nothing to say.",
        "id-id": "Panji Brassbelly jatuh. Jalan-jalan kembali terbuka, dan kereta-kereta kembali melaju. Untuk sekali ini, sang Baron kehabisan kata-kata."
